# Playwright's run artifacts (task web:e2e). test-results/ is written on EVERY
# run, including a passing one — it holds .last-run.json — so without this the
# tree is dirty after any E2E run, and `scripts/gate` refuses to run against a
# dirty worktree. Biome needs telling separately (biome.json's files.includes):
# MEASURED, it does not read this file, and it reported .last-run.json as a
# formatting error until it was excluded there too.
test-results/
